WEBVTT

00:01:58.956 --> 00:02:00.916
at the age of seven.

00:02:00.956 --> 00:02:05.236
She was admitted
into intensive care five times

00:02:05.276 --> 00:02:09.436
and put in an induced coma
to save her life

00:02:09.436 --> 00:02:11.996
when her lungs gave up on her.

00:02:12.756 --> 00:02:15.996
It wasn't until after
the first coroner's inquest

00:02:16.036 --> 00:02:18.356
in September 2014

00:02:18.396 --> 00:02:22.836
that I learned that her possible trigger
of her sudden illness

00:02:22.876 --> 00:02:26.516
was to do with "something in the air."

00:02:26.556 --> 00:02:29.316
But at that time,
we did not know what it was.

00:02:29.996 --> 00:02:34.236
Ella had one of the worst
cases ever of asthma